-- Generating done
```

### 4.2 编译

```powershell
& $cmake --build build --config Release
```

成功时会看到：

```text
opencv_demo.vcxproj -> C:\Users\Lenovo\opencv_demo\build\Release\opencv_demo.exe
已成功生成。
    0 个警告
    0 个错误
```

### 4.3 运行

```powershell
.\build\Release\opencv_demo.exe
