## 5. CMakeLists.txt 逐段说明

```cmake
cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.16)

project(opencv_demo LANGUAGES CXX)

set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD 17)
set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD_REQUIRED ON)
set(CMAKE_CXX_EXTENSIONS OFF)
```

- 要求 CMake 至少是 3.16。
- 项目名 `opencv_demo`，只使用 C++。
- 使用 C++17。

```cmake
find_package(OpenCV REQUIRED)
```

这是作业要求的核心：

- CMake 会去寻找 `OpenCVConfig.cmake`。
- 找到后自动设置：
  - `OpenCV_VERSION`
  - `OpenCV_INCLUDE_DIRS`
  - `OpenCV_LIBS`
- `REQUIRED` 表示找不到就报错，不继续生成。

```cmake
message(STATUS "OpenCV version: ${OpenCV_VERSION}")
message(STATUS "OpenCV include dirs: ${OpenCV_INCLUDE_DIRS}")
message(STATUS "OpenCV libraries: ${OpenCV_LIBS}")
```

把找到的版本、头文件目录、库名打印出来，方便检查。

```cmake
add_executable(opencv_demo main.cpp)
```

用 `main.cpp` 生成可执行程序 `opencv_demo`。

```cmake
target_include_directories(opencv_demo PRIVATE ${OpenCV_INCLUDE_DIRS})
```

把 OpenCV 的头文件目录加入编译器的搜索路径，否则会报：

```text
opencv2/opencv.hpp: No such file or directory
```

```cmake
target_link_libraries(opencv_demo PRIVATE ${OpenCV_LIBS})
```

把 OpenCV 的库链接进 exe，否则会报大量：

```text
unresolved external symbol ...
```

`PRIVATE` 表示这是 `opencv_demo` 自己使用的依赖。

```cmake
if(MSVC)
    target_compile_options(opencv_demo PRIVATE /utf-8 /W4)
endif()
```

- `/utf-8`：告诉 MSVC 源文件是 UTF-8。
- 不加它，中文注释在中文 Windows 的 GBK 代码页下可能出现 `C4819`，甚至导致编译错误。
- `/W4`：打开较严格的警告。

```cmake
add_custom_command(TARGET opencv_demo POST_BUILD
    COMMAND ${CMAKE_COMMAND} -E copy_directory
        "${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/images"
        "$<TARGET_FILE_DIR:opencv_demo>/images"
)
```

把 `images` 文件夹复制到 exe 旁边。这样从 `build\Release` 运行时，默认的 `images/sample.jpg` 也能找到。

```cmake
if(WIN32)
    file(GLOB OPENCV_RUNTIME_DLLS
        "${OpenCV_DIR}/x64/*/bin/opencv_*.dll"
    )
    list(FILTER OPENCV_RUNTIME_DLLS EXCLUDE REGEX "d\\.dll$")
    if(OPENCV_RUNTIME_DLLS)
        add_custom_command(TARGET opencv_demo POST_BUILD
            COMMAND ${CMAKE_COMMAND} -E copy_if_different
                ${OPENCV_RUNTIME_DLLS}
                "$<TARGET_FILE_DIR:opencv_demo>"
        )
    endif()
endif()
```

Windows 下 OpenCV 通常是动态库：

- 编译时需要 `.lib`。
- 运行时需要 `.dll`，例如 `opencv_world500.dll`。
- 这一段把 Release 所需的 OpenCV DLL 复制到 exe 旁边。
- 不复制的话，双击 exe 可能报“找不到 opencv_world500.dll”。

